    "### **How to Install Libraries **\n",
    "\n",
    "write following code in the terminal to install single library\n",
    "\n",
    "pip install [library name]\n",
    "\n",
    "write following code in the terminal to install more than one library simultaneously\n",
    "\n",
    "pip install pandas numpy matplotlib seaborn plotly scipystats scikit-learn streamlit"
   ]
  }
